		"_script_name_": "IMI_UZI"
		"descr_English": u"The Uzi is a family of Israeli open-bolt, blowback-operated submachine guns. Smaller variants are considered to be machine pistols. The Uzi was one of the first weapons to use a telescoping bolt design which allows the magazine to be housed in the pistol grip for a shorter weapon."
		"descr_Russian": u"Семейство пистолет-пулемётов, выпускаемых израильским концерном Israel Military Industries (IMI). Название \"Узи\" было дано в честь конструктора оружия Узиэля Галя."
