		"_script_name_": "FRANCHI_SPAS_12"
		"descr_English": u"The Franchi SPAS-12 is a combat shotgun manufactured by Italian firearms company Franchi from 1979 to 2000. Only five percent (about 1,850) of the estimated SPAS-12 shotguns manufactured were imported into the United States. The SPAS-12 is a dual-mode shotgun, adjustable for semi-automatic or pump-action operation."
		"descr_Russian": u"(Special Purpose Automatic Shotgun - автоматическое ружьё специального назначения) - итальянское ружьё, разработанное в конце 1970-ых годов."
