		"_script_name_": "BARRETT_M82A1"
		"descr_English": u"The M82, standardized by the US Military as the M107, is a recoil-operated, semi-automatic anti-materiel rifle developed by the American Barrett Firearms Manufacturing company. A heavy SASR (Special Application Scoped Rifle), it is used by many units and armies around the world. It is also called the \"Light Fifty\" for its .50 BMG (12.7x99mm NATO) chambering. The weapon is found in two variants, the original M82A1 (and A3) and the bullpup M82A2. The M82A2 is no longer manufactured, though the XM500 can be seen as its successor."
		"descr_Russian": u"Крупнокалиберная антиматериальная винтовка, выпускаемая компанией \"Barrett Firearms\". На сегодня винтовка М82 состоит на вооружении многих армий мира, включая армию США.Снайперская винтовка против тяжелой брони. Оптика 10x."
		"exp_Level": 1
		"isOldItem": True
