		"_script_name_": "OC_14_1"
		"descr_English": u"The OTs-14 Groza (ОЦ-14 \"Гроза\") is a Russian selective fire bullpup assault rifle chambered for the 7.62x39 round and the 9x39mm subsonic round. It was developed in the 1990s at the TsKIB SOO (Central Design and Research Bureau of Sporting and Hunting Arms) in Tula, Russia. The weapon is colloquially known as OC-14 or OTs-14 \"Groza\" (\"Thunderstorm\"). The OTs-14-4A \"Groza-4\" has one derivative, the TKB-0239 (ТКБ-0239), also known as OTs-14-1A \"Groza-1\", chambered for the 7.62x39mm round."
		"descr_Russian": u"Российский штурмовой стрелково-гранатомётный комплекс, разработанный ЦКИБ СОО в 1989 году. Представляет собой необычный вариант автомата АКС-74У, выполненный по схеме булл-пап. На него устанавливается несколько упрощённый вариант подствольного гранатомёта ГП-25 \"Костёр\""
		"exp_Level": 1
		"isOldItem": True
		"isnonDonatBaseStorable": True
		"isnonStorable": False
		"isnotDropable": True
		"isnotGiftable": True
		"isnotPlaceableAtBB": True
		"isnotRepairable": True
		"isnotSellableToNPC": True
		"isnotTradeable": True
		"name_English": u"Groza OC-14-1A 7.62x39 (Storm-1) Assault Rifle"
		"name_Russian": u"Автомат ОЦ-14 под 7.62x39"
		"short_name_English": u"old Groza-1"
		"short_name_Russian": u"Стар. Гроза-1"
		"storename_English": ""
		"storename_Russian": ""
	}, 

